With these edits:
- The `disabled` prop is pulled out of `...rest` and defaults to `false`.
- A new CSS modifier class `--snippet--disabled` is output when `disabled` is `true`.
- The inline snippet hides its copy button when disabled.
- The single‐line snippet container will not be keyboard‐focusable when disabled.
- The built‐in `<CopyButton>` is marked disabled.
- The public API now supports `<CodeSnippet disabled>` out of the box.
